SUMMARY:Academic Integrity Quiz - Due
LOCATION:Engineering Ready Modules (2026)
DESCRIPTION:This quiz will introduce you to some scenarios that you could e
	ncounter in your first year of study\, and throughout your post-secondary e
	ducation. Give the questions an attempt and test your understanding of what
	 it means to act with integrity in the university environment.\n\n\nQuizzes
	:\nAcademic Integrity Quiz - https://learn.uwaterloo.ca/d2l/lms/quizzing/qu
	izzing.d2l?ou=1271136&qi=318951\n\n\nView event - https://learn.uwaterloo.c
