BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20260918T200345Z
SUMMARY:MATH 116 Course Outline Scavenger Hunt - Due
LOCATION:Engineering Ready Modules (2026)
DESCRIPTION:The MATH 116 Course Outline Scavenger Hunt is set up as a quiz 
	is to let you explore how to take a quiz in the LEARN platform. Completing 
	this will also help you become familiar with the different components of a 
	course outline.\nThis quiz is not graded\, and you can retake it as many ti
	mes as you would like. You will need to refer to the Math116 Course Outline
	 to complete the quiz. You can also review the Module 2 Course Outline sect
	ion for clues to where specific course information can be found in a course
	 outline. \nPlease note that the course outline used is just a sample cours
	e outline for a first-year engineering course and is for illustrative purpo
	ses only. Different courses may have their course outlines structured diffe
	rently.\n\n\nQuizzes:\nMATH 116 Course Outline Scavenger Hunt - https://lea
	rn.uwaterloo.ca/d2l/lms/quizzing/quizzing.d2l?ou=1271136&qi=318952\n\n\nVie
	w event - https://learn.uwaterloo.ca/d2l/le/calendar/1271136/event/3747431/
	detailsview?ou=1271136#3747431
CLASS:PUBLIC
DTSTART:20270501T035959Z
DTEND:20270501T035959Z
UID:6606-3747431@learn.uwaterloo.ca
SEQUENCE:19
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T164245Z
